        "2026-10-09, relock worker on puk after the host bundle changed at 2026-10-09T07:20+02:00: diff -rq of every skill in both the revision's skills/ and ~/.agents/skills against all 18 commits of backnotprop/pstack main and upstream (no tags exist). Only 3a604672c46c (main HEAD) matches: all 51 upstream skills are installed and byte-identical. 1edf0a5 differs in 2 skills, 124f622 in 10, older revisions in more. Record: .orchestration/reports/CC-27/pstack-provenance-20261009.txt.",
